<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hoyts half year net A$12.17 million.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hoyts half year net A$12.17 million.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended January 2</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     20.99</p>
